# ICSR Case Processing Simulation

## Objective

This project demonstrates practical understanding of the end-to-end Individual Case Safety Report (ICSR) processing workflow in pharmacovigilance.

## Workflow

Report Receipt
→ Triage
→ ICSR Validity Assessment
→ Case Creation
→ Data Entry
→ Drug Coding
→ MedDRA Coding
→ Seriousness Assessment
→ Causality Assessment
→ Narrative Writing
→ Quality Control

## Skills Practiced

- ICSR validity assessment
- Triage
- Suspect drug identification
- Adverse event identification
- Indication vs adverse event differentiation
- Seriousness assessment
- Outcome assessment
- Causality assessment
- MedDRA coding concepts
- WHODrug coding concepts
- Case narrative preparation
- Quality control

## Cases

| Case | Scenario | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Case 001 | Drug-associated abdominal pain with hospitalization | Completed |

## Disclaimer

All cases in this repository are simulated educational cases created for pharmacovigilance training. No confidential patient information or proprietary company data is used.
